input:"Accepts a target element ID and moveDistance value that configure which game object to move and by how many pixels per control action.",
behavior:"Generates client-side JavaScript that wires up button click handlers to move the target DOM element, notify the backend via a fetch call, and toggle between start, game, and result screens to drive interactive gameplay flow."
